# Tenant Resolution

- Treat tenant resolution as a first-class security concern.
- Follow the repo's established resolution order for hostname, subdomain, and local-development fallback.
- Missing or disabled tenants must fail closed and must not fall through to another tenant.
- Do not duplicate tenant-resolution logic in many places when shared middleware or package helpers already exist.
- When debugging tenant issues, capture request host, resolved tenant source, and correlation identifiers.
